          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🐾</div>
            <h3>Nail &amp; Paw Care</h3>
            <p>Quick, careful nail trims, paw pad tidying, and a soothing paw balm.</p>
            <p class="price">From $20</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌸</div>
            <h3>Spa Package</h3>
            <p>Our signature treatment: oatmeal bath, de-shedding, teeth brushing, and a bandana.</p>
            <p class="price">From $95</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About -->
    <section id="about" class="about">
      <div class="container about-inner">
        <div class="about-image">🐶</div>
        <div>
          <h2 style="text-align:left;">Patient Hands, Happy Pups</h2>
          <p>Pawsh was founded in 2018 by certified groomers who believed grooming should be a positive experience for dogs and their owners. Our salon is designed to be quiet and low-stress, with separate spaces for nervous pups and a cage-free drying area.</p>
          <p>Every groomer is certified, insured, and trained in low-stress handling. We never rush, and we always communicate with you before and after every visit.</p>
          <a href="#book" class="btn btn-outline">Meet Our Team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reviews -->
    <section id="reviews">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">Real words from real dog parents.</p>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card testimonial">
            <p>"My anxious rescue used to shake at the groomer. The team at Pawsh had him relaxed and wagging in minutes."</p>
            <span class="author">— Jordan M.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card testimonial">
            <p>"The best haircut my doodle has ever had. They listened to exactly what I wanted and sent photos at pickup."</p>
            <span class="author">— Priya K.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="card testimonial">
            <p>"Our 14-year-old beagle gets the senior spa treatment every month. He comes home sleepy and happy every time."</p>
            <span class="author">— Tom and Linda R.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Booking CTA -->
    <section id="book">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta">
          <h2>Ready for a Fresh Cut?</h2>
          <p>Openings fill up fast. Book online in under two minutes, or give us a call.</p>
          <a href="tel:+15555550123" class="btn btn-primary">Call (555) 555-0123</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Visit Us -->
    <section id="visit">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Visit Us</h2>
        <p class="subtitle">Walk-ins welcome when space allows. Appointments recommended.</p>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <div class="info-box">
            <h3>Hours</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Monday – Friday: 8:00 AM – 6:00 PM</li>
              <li>Saturday: 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM</li>
              <li>Sunday: 10:00 AM – 3:00 PM</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="info-box">
            <h3>Location &amp; Contact</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>123 Maple Street, Springfield</li>
              <li>Phone: (555) 555-0123</li>
              <li>Free parking in front of the salon</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Pawsh<span>.</span></a>
      <p>Gentle grooming for dogs of all sizes.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Pawsh Dog Grooming. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
```
